@startuml
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderThickness 1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "TESTER" as T
participant "IssueService" as IS
participant "PermissionManager" as PM
participant "IssueRepository" as IR
participant "Issue" as I

title UC04 이슈 등록 - SD

== 사전 조건: 사용자 로그인 완료 ==

T -> IS : createIssue(projectId, newIssue, currentUser)

IS -> PM : canCreateIssue(currentUser)
PM --> IS : true

alt 권한 없음
  IS --> T : false\n("이슈 생성 권한이 없습니다")
end

IS -> IR : findAll()
IR --> IS : List<Issue>

IS -> I : id = nextId
IS -> I : projectId = projectId
IS -> I : reporter = currentUser.getId()
IS -> I : reportedDate = LocalDateTime.now()

IS -> IR : saveAll(issues)
IR --> IS : void

IS --> T : true\n("이슈가 생성되었습니다 (ID: " + nextId + ")")

== 사후 조건: 이슈 저장 완료, status = NEW ==

